# Ambush Gigapede: "When this creature enters, target creature an opponent controls gets -2/-2 until end of turn." On turn 3
# the trigger offers Bot2's two creatures and not Bot1's own Ornithopter (the refusal, beside the positive control: the legal
# target that is chosen). Bot2's Ornithopter, 0/2, becomes -2/0 and dies as a state-based action (CR 704.5f), while its
# Concealing Curtains, not chosen, stays untouched. Bot1's own Ornithopter is not affected.

